12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The Captains held a meeting to decide who would go to train in the Heart Kingdom.

13
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Five of the Black Bulls.

14
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Asta.

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Nero.

16
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Luck.

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Finral.

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,000
And Noelle.

19
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Mimosa from the Golden Dawn.

20
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Leopold of the Crimson Lion Kings.

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Captain Charlotte chose to nominate herself,

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
